The Investment Opportunities subsystem functions as the strategic acquisition intelligence layer of the LEGAiSEE CommandCenter.

It ensures that external systems are evaluated systematically for their ability to enhance capability, reduce cost, or accelerate system evolution.

It connects internal system intelligence with external ecosystem opportunity.

